<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Furama Hotel shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Furama Hotel shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares in Furama Hotel Enterprises Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.65 to end at HK$26 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Furama Hotel said earlier that third parties had approached its 45.42 percent controlling shareholder Townsend International Ltd about buying a stake in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
